    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>SPUD CUSTOMS 1.1.0</strong></i> - Stamp Visas. Launch Missiles. Save Potatoes.</h2><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the nation of Spud, you're the last line between fragile peace and total chaos. Each shift tests your judgment: inspect documents, expose lies, and defend your checkpoint with missile systems. \ud83c\udf5f</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Across 17 interactive cutscenes, you'll make 22 crucial choices</strong> \u2014 each one shaping the destiny of innocent (and not-so-innocent) potatoes.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/7b5c9343df6b9caa4a7aa4ed323fbda0.poster.avif?t=1745717693\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/7b5c9343df6b9caa4a7aa4ed323fbda0.webm?t=1745717693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/7b5c9343df6b9caa4a7aa4ed323fbda0.mp4?t=1745717693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspect, Judge, Fire:</strong> Master the checkpoint. Approve visas, deny liars, and unleash missiles if needed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Storylines:</strong> 22 decision points across 17 interactive scenes lead to dramatically different endings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas:</strong> Will you enforce cruel laws... or risk everything to save innocent spuds?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayable and Relentless:</strong> Multiple endings, endless score attack mode, and over 12 achievements to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Perfect for Any Schedule:</strong> Quick 5\u201315 minute shifts, simple controls, deep choices, and save anytime.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Difficulty Options:</strong> Adjust document time pressure and defense systems to match your style \u2014 Story, Normal, or Expert Modes available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built for Steam Deck &amp; Controllers:</strong> Full controller support and keybinding customization included.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/9b2b034f3aa03c720ee4836a18bad651.poster.avif?t=1745717693\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/9b2b034f3aa03c720ee4836a18bad651.webm?t=1745717693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/9b2b034f3aa03c720ee4836a18bad651.mp4?t=1745717693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NEW IN VERSION 1.1.0:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Demo Available!</strong> Experience the checkpoint chaos before you buy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Localization</strong> \u2014 19 languages now supported.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced Gameplay Systems</strong> \u2014 Improved checkpoint flow, refined missile targeting, better UI feedback.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance Optimizations</strong> \u2014 Faster loading, smoother operation.</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/0dca5479e4e76b1de3cf6cc5fdc184b2.poster.avif?t=1745717693\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/0dca5479e4e76b1de3cf6cc5fdc184b2.webm?t=1745717693\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3291880/extras/0dca5479e4e76b1de3cf6cc5fdc184b2.mp4?t=1745717693\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join the Spud Customs Front Lines!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play free with the demo today</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the fate of Spud, one decision at a time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of <i>Papers, Please</i>, <i>Not Tonight</i>, and unique story-driven indie games</p></li></ul><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd54 Your shift begins now. Will you follow orders... or forge your own path? \ud83e\udd54</p>",
